        "title": "Accessibility Basics",
        "type": "practiceLevel2",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Question: Why Accessibility?",
            "id": 116250,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why should we write accessible code?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"4\" correct=\"true\">Both options</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">To make web pages accessible for everyone, including people with disabilities</item><item value=\"5\" correct=\"false\">To provide users with a meaningful way to navigate and interact with your website</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Both options.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A visitor uses a screen reader and another has a slow connection. Which goal accounts for both when you code a page?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Make content usable across different user needs and access conditions.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Optimize only for users who can see every image.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Make every browser show identical fonts and colors.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Support only screen-reader users and ignore connection speed.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make content usable across different user needs and access conditions.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: How are web pages accessible?",
            "id": 116281,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How can we make code more accessible?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">By coding HTML in a semantic manner</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">By ignoring non-mandatory attributes like <code>alt</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">By designing the website based on the user experience of general users</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">By coding HTML in a semantic manner.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A page has headings, navigation, and content sections. Which coding choice gives their meaning to assistive technology?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">By coding HTML in a semantic manner</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">By ignoring non-mandatory attributes like <code>alt</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">By designing the website based on the user experience of general users</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">By replacing headings with styled <code>div</code> elements</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">By coding HTML in a semantic manner.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: <header>,<nav>,<footer>,etc",
            "id": 116287,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why should we use elements like <code>&lt;header&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;nav&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;footer&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;main&gt;</code>, etc?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">So that users using a screen reader can jump to sections of a web page</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Because otherwise the webpage won't work</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">So that it looks fancy</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">So that users using a screen reader can jump to sections of a web page.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Screen readers use semantic page regions to help users navigate.</p><p>You replace <code>main</code> with a generic <code>div</code> while keeping the same appearance. Which benefit can users lose?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Jumping directly to the identified main content region.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Seeing larger text, because main always enlarges it.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Loading the page, because div cannot contain page content.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Following all links, because links require a main parent.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Jumping directly to the identified main content region.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Generic elements",
            "id": 116319,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which of the following is <em>not</em> a generic element?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;header&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;div&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;span&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;header&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which element gives a page region meaning instead of acting as a generic container?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;header&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;div&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;span&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;section&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;header&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Headings",
            "id": 116291,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We are trying to keep a page as accessible as possible. Should we have an <code>h2</code> after an <code>h5</code> on the same page section?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No, we must keep the heading order</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yes, we can use headings for styling</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">No, <code>&lt;h5&gt;</code> comes after <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No, we must keep the heading order.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>You want an <code>h5</code> to look larger without changing its place in the heading hierarchy. Which change fits?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Change its CSS appearance while keeping the h5 element.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Replace it with h2 purely for the larger default text.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Remove the heading element and use plain text.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Choose a heading rank only by its default font size.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Change its CSS appearance while keeping the h5 element.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: alert role",
            "id": 117323,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What is wrong with this code?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"alert\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"This session will expire in 10 seconds. \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The <code>\"alert\"</code> value should have double quotes </item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nothing, It works for me</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The <code>\"alert\"</code> value should have double quotes .</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The unquoted <code>alert</code> value is valid HTML.</p><p>Which edit would change the urgent-message meaning communicated by the container?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"alert\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"This session will expire in 10 seconds. \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Replace alert with contentinfo in the role attribute.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Put double quotes around alert.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Remove the space after the message text.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Replace alert with contentinfo in the role attribute.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: aria-hidden",
            "id": 117331,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Does the webpage display two paragraphs in this example?<br /></p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"aria-hidden\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Music Festival\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Coming Soon\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Yes, because the attribute hides content only to screen readers</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No, it won't display <code>\"Music Festival\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Yes, because the attribute hides content only to screen readers.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A sighted visitor opens this page while a screen reader reads it. Which statement correctly describes the paragraph with <code>aria-hidden</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"aria-hidden\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Music Festival\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Coming Soon\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Yes, because the attribute hides content only to screen readers</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No, it won't display <code>\"Music Festival\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">It is hidden visually but still announced by a screen reader</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Yes, because the attribute hides content only to screen readers.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: banner role",
            "id": 117318,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The <code>img</code> and <code>h1</code> elements have informative content and they're located at the top of a page. Include the proper role of the <code>div</code> that contains them.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;banner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/forrest-walk.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"alt\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;forrest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200px&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" /&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Forest Walk Website\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"50\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>banner</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: contentinfo role",
            "id": 117568,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>These pieces of information should appear at the bottom of every page. What <code>role</code> do we need to use here?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;contentinfo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Accessibility Tutorial\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Version 1\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Copyright © 2012-2013\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"banner\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>contentinfo</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>banner</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>comment</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>contentinfo</code>.</p><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>contentinfo</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Give the bottom-of-page copyright and version block the role for page footer information.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;contentinfo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Accessibility Tutorial\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Version 1\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Copyright © 2012-2013\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"banner\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"main\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"navigation\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>role</code>, followed by <code>contentinfo</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: aria-hidden",
            "id": 117332,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We must hide the <code>button</code> and the <code>p</code> elements from the screen readers. Let's add the correct attribute to hide them.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"aria-hidden\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Some button\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Screen Readers shouldn't see this\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"aria\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"aria-hide\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>aria-hidden</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the existing div container. Keep this noninteractive decorative group visible but hide it from screen readers.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"aria-hidden\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"span\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Decorative flourish\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"span\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Decorative text\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"hidden\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"role\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;false&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>div</code>, followed by <code>aria-hidden</code>, and finally <code>\"true\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
        ]
